Data attribution

`data/splits/cohort_metadata.csv` is derived from PTB-XL v1.0.3:

    Wagner, P., Strodthoff, N., Bousseljot, R.-D., et al.
    PTB-XL, a large publicly available electrocardiography dataset.
    Scientific Data 7, 154 (2020).  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-020-0495-6

PTB-XL is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
licence (CC-BY 4.0). The derived table in this repository is redistributed under
the same licence and carries the same attribution. The waveform data itself is
not redistributed; download it from https://physionet.org/content/ptb-xl/1.0.3/.
